[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 24366.628, "timestamp": "06:46:06", "text": "盛大的活動。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24379.67, "timestamp": "06:46:19", "text": "可能會說，哦，就算戴著圍巾也沒關係，真的沒關係，這只是一個介紹性的活動，對吧？沒關係。但是，我以前剛開始的時候，總是把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24382.468, "timestamp": "06:46:22", "text": "它當作一件大事，心想哪天我能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24385.03, "timestamp": "06:46:25", "text": "自己做所有的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24391.35, "timestamp": "06:46:31", "text": "事情，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24400.868, "timestamp": "06:46:40", "text": "我出道的日子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 24407.83, "timestamp": "06:46:47", "text": "。所以，五年後，我甚至都沒能做到。不，更確切地說，我嘗試了很多事情來讓自己能夠獨立完成，例如模特兒等等。雖然"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 24415.587, "timestamp": "06:46:55", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "You're doing well if I say so..... I'm glad you were recommended on my page"}]